067818618", "personaname": "Pigeon Pecking Keyboard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pigeonunnobled/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 46175, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 37234, "last_played": 1789143411, "avatar": "d8f4de03ae2ff3c38c53863b943208902702c2c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's plain just dumb fun in co-op. Listening in on NPC's proximity chats when you're running among them yields more cheese than the Princess Bride. And you can sing with them too! (brilliant move, Sandlot)\n\nYou will need help, if this is your first EDF. There's a learning curve and the game's not great in teaching you much.\n\n\"They look just like us! 2 feet, 2 eyes..\"", "timestamp_created": 1763707151, "timestamp_updated": 1763707151, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.595952510833740234", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "209728266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198198340483", "personaname": "General Steiner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rtsoldier/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 83, "playtime_forever": 3073, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3073, "last_played": 1758827244, "avatar": "9e8b98152f9384b7a94a7d75c735eddfdf2e486c"}, "language": "english", "review": "After completing the story on Normal and ultimately finishing the story I can positivly say I enjoyed the game even though it took me another try 4 years later.\r\n\r\nThe classes are a bit of a hit and miss, I used wing diver 95% of the time and Fencer, I enjoyed Fencer the most BUT I didn't use it at the end since I needed mobility and to get in and out of places fast.\r\n\r\nGood selection of Enemies, A lot of weapons to choose from 110 missions to complete with 2 new difficulties so you have that replayability if you so desire.\r\n\r\nYes graphics ain't that great but I had no problem with them really.\r\n\r\nOverall score: 8/10 ✅ ✅", "timestamp_created": 1763679252, "timestamp_updated": 1763679252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480225980281829834", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209695469", "author": {"steamid": "76561199046120630", "personaname": "Seenow123", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199046120630/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 5432, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 273, "playtime_at_review": 4583, "last_played": 1789870935, "avatar": "3de95801369219c9cb490870b4489f116be4806a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love playing the final level of halo reach, and winning.", "timestamp_created": 1763650352, "timestamp_updated": 1763650352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}